Her campaign combines household affordability with a focus on family farms, workforce opportunity, clean water, rural health, public safety and border security. | As a state senator, Trone Garriott supported Waukee's request for federal transportation funding
for University Avenue improvements, including road connections, emergency-response access,
pedestrian links and flood mitigation.

These are proposals, not enacted federal programs, but they give voters specific ways to compare
how candidates connect medical bills with the wider cost of living. | *([Sarah
for Iowa, "Health care"](https://sarahforiowa.com/issue/health-care-thats-affordable-and-there-when-you-need-it/);
[VPM candidate survey](https://www.vpm.org/elections/2026-09-23/va01-taylor-wittman-candidate-survey/);
[Cooke campaign priorities](https://cookeforwisconsin.com/priorities/).)*

